    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Discover Mariners Point, Ardale’s latest residential development in the heart of Wicklow Town, offering an exceptional collection of luxurious 3, 4 and 5-bedroom family homes.\r\n\r\nSet between the majestic Wicklow Mountains and the Irish Sea, Mariners Point combines contemporary family living with the natural beauty and character of one of Ireland’s most scenic towns. Designed with modern family life in mind, these high-quality homes offer generous living spaces, excellent amenities and an enviable setting, with stunning coastal and mountain views adding to their appeal.\r\n\r\nWicklow Town is a truly special place to call home. Known as the gateway to the “Garden of Ireland,” it offers an enviable balance of natural beauty, community and convenience. From coastal walks and open countryside to local shops, schools, cafés and everyday amenities, everything you need is close at hand.\r\n\r\nFor families looking for space, fresh air and a more relaxed pace of life without sacrificing connectivity, Mariners Point is an ideal choice. Dublin City is within easy reach, allowing residents to enjoy the opportunities and convenience of the capital while returning home to the tranquillity of Wicklow.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re looking to put down roots, create more space for your family or embrace a lifestyle surrounded by nature, Mariners Point offers the perfect setting for your next chapter.\r\n\r\nTo find out more, contact Savills New Homes 01 618 1300.or Forkin Earl Properties on (0404) 61933"
      },
      {
